301
00:08:12,950 --> 00:08:14,890
So buy, or don't.

302
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:17,050
A piece may find you either way.

303
00:08:17,200 --> 00:08:18,970
And it comes without a say.

304
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:22,070
But look at who else has none.

305
00:08:22,270 --> 00:08:23,890
Even Amazon and Google,

306
00:08:23,930 --> 00:08:25,490
which each own a large slice

307
00:08:25,530 --> 00:08:26,200
of this company,

308
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:28,460
hold shares with no vote at all.

309
00:08:28,880 --> 00:08:30,530
As this company is built today,

310
00:08:30,570 --> 00:08:32,360
the wheel is not for sale.

311
00:08:32,490 --> 00:08:33,730
At any price.

312
00:08:33,990 --> 00:08:35,240
That's the hopeful part.

313
00:08:35,560 --> 00:08:36,560
The hard part:

314
00:08:36,710 --> 00:08:38,770
it rests with eleven people.

315
00:08:38,940 --> 00:08:40,130
Seven founders.

316
00:08:40,220 --> 00:08:41,310
Four trustees.

317
00:08:41,530 --> 00:08:42,950
The same dinner table.

318
00:08:43,530 --> 00:08:44,280
But the board they

319
00:08:44,320 --> 00:08:45,840
choose is bound,

320
00:08:45,880 --> 00:08:47,520
by the company's legal form,

321
00:08:47,590 --> 00:08:49,100
to weigh three things.

322
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:50,800
The shareholders' money.

323
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:53,110
The company's stated purpose.

324
00:08:53,410 --> 00:08:55,000
And the interests of everyone

325
00:08:55,040 --> 00:08:56,320
materially affected by

326
00:08:56,360 --> 00:08:57,420
what it does.

327
00:08:58,040 --> 00:08:59,300
Now recall the warning

328
00:08:59,340 --> 00:09:00,360
in the document.

329
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:02,390
Risks to humanity.

330
00:09:02,860 --> 00:09:03,700
Who is materially

331
00:09:03,740 --> 00:09:04,940
affected by that?

332
00:09:05,280 --> 00:09:06,260
You are.

333
00:09:06,300 --> 00:09:08,190
With a share, or without.

334
00:09:09,520 --> 00:09:11,460
You can buy a piece of AI.

335
00:09:11,630 --> 00:09:13,390
You can't buy a say in it.

336
00:09:13,650 --> 00:09:14,500
But you never needed

337
00:09:14,540 --> 00:09:16,370
a share to have a stake.

338
00:09:16,970 --> 00:09:19,030
And a stake has a voice.

339
00:09:19,260 --> 00:09:20,970
A senator used hers.

340
00:09:21,220 --> 00:09:22,130
A city's pension

341
00:09:22,170 --> 00:09:23,750
watchdog used his.

342
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:25,870
And now there is a public record

343
00:09:25,910 --> 00:09:28,160
to hold up when you use yours.

344
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:30,210
A share has a price.

345
00:09:30,330 --> 00:09:31,930
A stake never did.

346
00:09:33,040 --> 00:09:34,110
This channel exists

347
00:09:34,150 --> 00:09:35,370
for one reason:

348
00:09:35,510 --> 00:09:36,400
so that the arrival

349
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:37,490
of superintelligence

350
00:09:37,530 --> 00:09:39,210
goes well for everybody.

351
00:09:39,550 --> 00:09:41,000
For the few who hold a share,

352
00:09:41,040 --> 00:09:43,180
and the billions who hold a stake.

353
00:09:43,510 --> 00:09:44,510
Want that too?

354
00:09:44,580 --> 00:09:45,580
Then subscribe.

